  The article says the Erode meeting was an 'ஆலோசனைக் கூட்டம்' and the reel says he spoke in Erode generally, which is consistent; however the reel_script states Edappadi Palaniswami as 'எடப்பாடி பழனிசாமி' while the article only says 'எடப்பாடியார்', an expansion of the name not stated in the article (minor, but an added detail)
  The reel_script says people 'நின்றனர்' and 'வணங்கிச் சென்றனர்' as a general statement, but the article attributes the 2 km aarathi queue and touching plates to his remarks, and the reel omits that the claim concerns his own election experience framed as his speech, which is an interpretation shift rather than a stated fact
  The slide 'எடப்பாடி பழனிசாமி முதல்வர் ஆவார் என்று சொன்னார்கள்' and the reel's 'நீங்கள்தான் அமைச்சர்' attribute the promise to unspecified people, while the article says 'போகிற இடமெல்லாம் சொன்னதை' — the reel says 'இடமெல்லாம் சொன்னதை' which is an ungrammatical phrasing with unclear meaning in Tamil
